@base = http://localhost:5000

### 1) Domainden firma config: ABC
GET {{base}}/api/firma/config
Host: abc.localhost

### 2) Domainden firma config: XYZ
GET {{base}}/api/firma/config
Host: xyz.localhost

### 3) Login: localhost'tan, firmaKodu body'de (ABC)
# @name loginAbc
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firmaKodu": "ABC", "kullaniciAdi": "admin", "sifre": "Abc123!" }

### 4) Login: aynı kullanıcı adı, XYZ firması (domainden)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Host: xyz.localhost
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "admin", "sifre": "Xyz123!" }

### 5) Token ile korumalı endpoint
GET {{base}}/api/auth/ben
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### 6) ABC token'ı XYZ domaininde -> 403
GET {{base}}/api/auth/ben
Host: xyz.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}
